.\" raz-lib(3) - the library; made by tools/Doc.raz from lib/
.Dd October 22, 2026
.Dt RAZ-LIB 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm raz-lib
.Nd the library of the raz language
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The modules a raz program imports from
.Pa lib/ ,
beside the compiler, each as its source gives it: the module's own
comment, then every declaration it exports, as it is written, with
the comment just before it.
A module's
.Ic main ,
where it has one, is its test, and is left out.
.Pp
The report's second volume says what the library promises, and which
of its modules every target has.
.Sh MODULES
